# Validation 04: WAW pseudo-dependency.
# Three LOADs write the same destination register R1 from
# the same address (mem[100]). The later LOADs overwrite
# the earlier ones' rename tags, but the CDB still retires
# the values in program order. The final ADD reads the
# third LOAD's value, demonstrating that Tomasulo's
# register renaming resolves the WAW without losing the
# intermediate results.
LOAD R1, 100(R0)
LOAD R1, 100(R0)
LOAD R1, 100(R0)
ADD R2, R1, R0
i
